    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*****UNDER OFFER*****\r\n\r\nCapture the ultimate country lifestyle with this charming, extended 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom cottage, perfectly nestled in a peaceful and tranquil countryside setting. Renovated in 2005, the property masterfully blends modern convenience with timeless cottage-style charm, retaining beautiful original features while offering a warm, inviting atmosphere that is ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nBoasting an impressive 4.17 acres of adjoining land, this property is a rare find, uniquely suited for equestrian enthusiasts, passionate horticulturists, or those dreaming of a self-sufficient smallholding. The home is designed for year-round comfort, featuring efficient oil-fired central heating alongside a cozy solid fuel stove, and comes fully serviced with mains water and an on-site septic tank.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned for both privacy and convenience, you can enjoy idyllic rural living without isolation. The property is ideally located just 10.5km from the vibrant heritage town of Listowel, 15km from Abbeyfeale, 20km from Castleisland, and 24km from the bustling hub of Tralee and Tralee General hospital.  There is hence a wide variety and easy access to excellent schools, shops, and amenities.  Viewings are highly advised.  Contact Dillon Prendiville Auctioneers for an appointment now on 068 21739."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Living/sitting/dining room - 4.1m x 4.3m \r\nWood flooring, exposed stone feature walls, solid fuel stove on granite hearth, dual aspect, vaulted latted ceiling and built in hotpress.  \r\n\r\nKitchen - 4.2m x 2.4m \r\nWood flooring, exposed stone feature walls, vaulted latted ceiling, dual aspect, fully fitted kitchen with Bosch Electric oven, hob and overhead extractor, stainless steel sink, plumbed for washing machine & attic access hatch. \r\n\r\nCorridor - 6.7m x 1.0m \r\nWood flooring, exposed stone wall, 2 x windows, vaulted latted ceiling. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.1m x 3.0m \r\nWood flooring, exposed stone feature walls, overlooking rear garden, vaulted latted ceiling and fire opening.  \r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.4m x 2.1m \r\nTiled floor & splash areas, frosted windows, wc, whb, bath with overhead Mira Elite shower, attic access & vaulted latted ceiling.  \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.6m x 4.5m \r\nWood flooring, dual aspect, latted ceiling.  \r\n\r\nMasonry lean to store - 5.4m x 3.8m \r\nFuel store\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Extended stone cottage - Mix of stone and block built twin leaf cavity.\r\nSlate roof replaced in c.2005 with PVC facia & soffit.\r\nDouble glazed teak windows.\r\nOn site septic tank and mains water.\r\nVaulted latted ceilings throughout.\r\nSet upon 1.69Ha/4.17 acres of land with independant access."
      },
